      "name": "Buzzsaw Axe",
      "quantity": 1,
      "description": "<p>With an aerodynamic cutting edge and a curved handle, this <em>+2 striking battle axe</em> is perfectly suited to whirling motions, and in fact seems like it wants to whirl free from your grip. A Strike with this axe that benefits from the sweep trait's circumstance bonus on attack rolls also gains a +2 circumstance bonus to the damage roll.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> command, Interact</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You hurl the axe, which spins at great speed as it flies to a distant point and returns to you, leaving a trail of carnage. Each creature in a @Template[line|distance:120] must succeed at a @Check[reflex|dc:28|basic|name:Thrown Buzzsaw Axe|traits:axe|showDC:all] save or take damage equal to the weapon's melee damage, including your Strength modifier.</p>",
